1
00:00:49,049 --> 00:00:51,468
Aku sudah mengincar tempat ini, Bajingan.

2
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:58,183
Kesempatan terakhir.

3
00:01:42,852 --> 00:01:48,149
Kenapa uang selalu kurang saat dibutuhkan?

4
00:01:49,526 --> 00:01:52,987
Aku selalu mengalaminya,
tapi selalu saja merasa pilu.

5
00:03:06,394 --> 00:03:08,229
Dia sehebat itu?

6
00:03:11,065 --> 00:03:12,775
Karena uang tak ada batasnya.

7
00:03:17,864 --> 00:03:18,781
Sial.

8
00:03:45,975 --> 00:03:47,769
Aku sangat suka raut kalian.

9
00:03:49,646 --> 00:03:51,940
Raut yang mengira diri kalian hebat.

10
00:03:55,985 --> 00:03:56,819
Tahu kenapa?

11
00:03:57,320 --> 00:04:00,031
Itu membuat raut wajah kalian saat mati

12
00:04:00,531 --> 00:04:02,492
menjadi lebih dramatis.

13
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:22,887
Terima.

14
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:28,142
Terima teleponnya.

15
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:47,412
Kau pasti sudah sangat paham.

16
00:04:48,288 --> 00:04:50,290
Uang adalah kekuatan. Ya, 'kan?

17
00:04:54,961 --> 00:04:56,462
Kau siapa?

18
00:04:57,797 --> 00:04:59,507
Aku Ketua Mundane Vanguard.

19
00:05:07,015 --> 00:05:10,852
Bagaimanapun, ini perang uang.
Pemenangnya yang lebih banyak uang.

20
00:05:11,352 --> 00:05:13,354
Kau sudah pasti akan kalah.

21
00:05:14,897 --> 00:05:17,775
Sudahi saja pertarungan kita.

22
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:20,445
Lebih baik kau

23
00:05:21,029 --> 00:05:22,572
jual kekuatanmu padaku.

24
00:05:40,923 --> 00:05:43,134
Kubayar sebanyak yang kauminta.

25
00:05:43,718 --> 00:05:44,719
Pertimbangkanlah.

26
00:05:46,262 --> 00:05:48,806
Sementara itu,
anggap kita gencatan senjata.

27
00:06:03,488 --> 00:06:07,283
Sejak hari itu,
Mundane Vanguard sunyi senyap.

28
00:06:10,078 --> 00:06:11,788
MIN-SUK

29
00:06:14,707 --> 00:06:15,541
Ya.

30
00:06:15,625 --> 00:06:17,418
- Selamat datang.
- Ya.

31
00:06:17,502 --> 00:06:18,795
Kau hampir sampai?

32
00:06:19,670 --> 00:06:21,255
Ya, sedikit lagi.

33
00:06:21,339 --> 00:06:23,966
Segera beri tahu
tentang pertemuan keluarga.

34
00:06:25,468 --> 00:06:26,302
Ya.

35
00:06:27,678 --> 00:06:28,554
Bagaimana kerjamu?

36
00:06:30,014 --> 00:06:32,266
Tak ada serah terima yang benar.

37
00:06:34,811 --> 00:06:36,062
Tak ada sistem juga.

38
00:06:38,731 --> 00:06:39,857
Kau tak masalah?

39
00:06:40,441 --> 00:06:43,152
Ya, karena mereka menggajiku tinggi.

40
00:06:43,236 --> 00:06:44,070
Kau sendiri?

41
00:06:47,156 --> 00:06:48,366
Aman, 'kan?

42
00:06:50,118 --> 00:06:51,160
Aku gelisah.

43
00:06:51,244 --> 00:06:52,620
Aman.

44
00:06:53,621 --> 00:06:55,206
Ya, nanti kutelepon lagi.

45
00:06:55,289 --> 00:06:56,999
- Ya.
- Ya.

46
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:18,563
DILARANG MASUK

47
00:07:18,646 --> 00:07:19,856
FORENSIK

48
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:26,988
- Rapikan barang buktinya…
- Hei!

49
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:29,240
Tolong cek sampai ke dalam danau.

50
00:07:29,323 --> 00:07:30,700
- Baik.
- Hati-hati.

51
00:07:30,783 --> 00:07:31,701
Kedalamannya.

52
00:07:32,285 --> 00:07:33,619
- Kau sedang apa?
- Ya?

53
00:07:33,703 --> 00:07:34,704
Tidak masuk?

54
00:07:37,498 --> 00:07:38,332
Sudah datang?

55
00:07:38,416 --> 00:07:41,544
- Ya. Ini jam berapa?
- Pukul sembilan kurang.

56
00:07:43,254 --> 00:07:45,339
Bukankah harus beli jam baru?

57
00:07:47,091 --> 00:07:49,552
Biar begini, ini warisan keluarga.

58
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:51,554
Kalau begitu, perbaikilah.

59
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:54,098
Tak ada suku cadangnya.

60
00:08:09,864 --> 00:08:10,865
Pak Ketua Tim!

61
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:12,742
Lihat ini.

62
00:08:14,619 --> 00:08:15,453
Aduh.

63
00:08:17,163 --> 00:08:18,331
Lihat ini.

64
00:08:18,414 --> 00:08:19,415
SURAT UTANG

65
00:08:19,499 --> 00:08:21,000
- Surat utang?
- Ya.

66
00:08:21,083 --> 00:08:22,710
Lihat namanya.

67
00:08:22,793 --> 00:08:24,879
Kang Sang…

68
00:08:25,379 --> 00:08:27,131
Apa benar "Sang"?

69
00:08:27,215 --> 00:08:31,010
Suami Kim Min-suk, wanita Hotel Cheongdam,
bernama Kang Sang-ung.

70
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,641
Menikah?

71
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:40,144
- Ya.
- Wah, itu bagus sekali.

72
00:08:40,228 --> 00:08:44,982
Ibu sangat khawatir
kau membujang sampai mati. Astaga.

73
00:08:45,066 --> 00:08:46,526
Membujang pun tak mati.

74
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:49,779
Bagi Ibu, Min-suk seperti Tuhan.

75
00:08:49,862 --> 00:08:51,239
Ya, ampun.

76
00:08:51,989 --> 00:08:52,823
Kalau Ayah?

77
00:08:54,951 --> 00:08:57,245
- Ayah…
- Tak perlu pendapatnya.

78
00:08:57,328 --> 00:08:59,956
- Selamat, ya.
- Ya, untuk apa pendapat Ayah?

79
00:09:01,958 --> 00:09:03,125
Jadi,

80
00:09:03,834 --> 00:09:05,920
kurasa perlu pertemuan orang tua.

81
00:09:06,003 --> 00:09:07,088
Tentu.

82
00:09:07,171 --> 00:09:09,090
Kami selalu siap kapan pun.

83
00:09:09,173 --> 00:09:11,509
Atur saja senyaman mertuamu. Ya?

84
00:09:11,592 --> 00:09:13,761
Sepertinya kita terlalu merendah…

85
00:09:13,844 --> 00:09:15,721
Aduh, tolong diam!

86
00:09:19,892 --> 00:09:22,728
Aku akan atur tanggalnya
dan mengabari kalian.

87
00:09:22,812 --> 00:09:24,689
Pokoknya, Ibu lega.

88
00:09:24,772 --> 00:09:25,982
Ya, ampun.

89
00:09:26,065 --> 00:09:27,441
Ibu akan siapkan nasi.

90
00:09:27,525 --> 00:09:29,569
- Makanlah sebelum pulang.
- Ya.

91
00:09:42,248 --> 00:09:43,207
Ayo kita bicara.

92
00:09:46,544 --> 00:09:47,461
Astaga.

93
00:09:51,841 --> 00:09:52,967
Kenapa?

94
00:09:53,551 --> 00:09:55,052
Ayah lupa bilang sesuatu?

95
00:09:55,845 --> 00:09:57,138
Ini bisa dijual.

96
00:09:57,221 --> 00:09:59,640
- Jual apa?
- Kekuatan super.

97
00:10:00,141 --> 00:10:02,226
Mundane Vanguard memintaku menjualnya.

98
00:10:03,102 --> 00:10:04,478
- Menjualnya?
- Ya.

99
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:07,398
- Bagaimana caranya?
- Apa?

100
00:10:07,481 --> 00:10:08,858
Apa sungguh bisa?

101
00:10:09,775 --> 00:10:13,029
- Mau dibayar berapa?
- Katanya, sebanyak yang kuminta.

102
00:10:13,946 --> 00:10:16,699
Apa hebatnya kekuatan super?

103
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:18,951
Lalu?

104
00:10:19,952 --> 00:10:21,120
Apa rencanamu?

105
00:10:21,704 --> 00:10:23,414
Tidak tahu. Ya, ampun.

106
00:10:25,458 --> 00:10:26,626
Hati-hati.

107
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:28,544
Mereka bahaya.

108
00:10:30,504 --> 00:10:32,923
Mereka bisa mencelakaimu. Hati-hati.

109
00:10:34,342 --> 00:10:35,343
Aku

110
00:10:36,844 --> 00:10:38,262
akan jujur satu hal.

111
00:10:40,431 --> 00:10:41,641
Apa Ayah tahu

112
00:10:42,975 --> 00:10:45,394
siapa yang paling merusak hidupku?

113
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:48,147
Siapa yang paling tak bisa kupercaya?

114
00:10:48,939 --> 00:10:49,857
Siapa?

115
00:10:50,358 --> 00:10:51,525
Aduh.

116
00:10:53,319 --> 00:10:54,362
Lupakan saja.

117
00:10:55,196 --> 00:10:57,239
Ya, ampun. Ayah tak tahu apa-apa.

118
00:11:03,996 --> 00:11:06,332
Mereka sudah ajukan, kita urus sisanya.

119
00:11:14,924 --> 00:11:16,717
Mungkin Ayah benar.

120
00:11:17,551 --> 00:11:19,178
Mereka tak bisa dipercaya.

121
00:11:19,804 --> 00:11:22,264
Ini pasti perang psikologis.

122
00:11:22,765 --> 00:11:24,809
- Astaga. Itu!
- Rumahku.

123
00:11:39,573 --> 00:11:40,825
PENGACARA MIRAS

124
00:11:40,908 --> 00:11:42,410
Tanya Pengacara Byeon?

125
00:11:43,244 --> 00:11:45,538
Hanya kau yang bisa menahan mereka.

126
00:11:46,831 --> 00:11:50,710
Tidak. Aku pasti dimarahi
karena bicara yang tidak-tidak.

127
00:11:52,086 --> 00:11:54,296
Kalau begitu, Ketua Park?

128
00:11:55,297 --> 00:11:57,925
Jadi 3,005 miliar won termasuk biaya tes.

129
00:11:58,426 --> 00:11:59,468
Tidak!

130
00:12:02,012 --> 00:12:02,972
JEONGJA UTANG

131
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:11,272
Oke.

132
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:14,024
Yang tersisa

133
00:12:14,775 --> 00:12:17,111
hanya satu orang.

134
00:12:27,413 --> 00:12:28,831
Selamat datang.

135
00:12:35,504 --> 00:12:36,589
Sedang makan, ya?

136
00:12:37,381 --> 00:12:39,008
Makanlah ini setelahnya.

137
00:12:42,511 --> 00:12:44,972
Stoknya hanya 200 buah sehari.

138
00:12:45,055 --> 00:12:48,559
Aku ke mal saat jam makan siang
dan mengantre sangat lama.

139
00:12:50,895 --> 00:12:52,772
Kenapa kau kira aku suka roti?

140
00:12:55,733 --> 00:12:56,859
Kalau salah,

141
00:12:58,068 --> 00:12:59,403
aku minta maaf.

142
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:02,031
Kalau begitu, makan saat berkelahi.

143
00:13:02,615 --> 00:13:04,450
Maksudmu, kubawa ini di saku?

144
00:13:04,533 --> 00:13:07,077
Satu per satu saja. Tak muat sekaligus.

145
00:13:13,667 --> 00:13:16,295
- Aku ingin tahu sesuatu.
- Apa?

146
00:13:19,298 --> 00:13:20,424
Apa kekuatan super

147
00:13:21,383 --> 00:13:23,010
bisa dijual?

148
00:13:26,263 --> 00:13:27,431
Dengar dari mana?

149
00:13:28,974 --> 00:13:29,809
Apa?

150
00:13:29,892 --> 00:13:32,436
Aku tak bertanya lagi.
Kau dengar dari mana?

151
00:13:39,819 --> 00:13:40,653
Mundane Vanguard.

152
00:13:43,405 --> 00:13:44,907
Mereka yang bilang.

153
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:48,577
Hanya kita yang belum menjual.

154
00:13:51,747 --> 00:13:52,790
Apa maksudmu?

155
00:13:53,666 --> 00:13:55,292
Sebenarnya Tuan Pengacara…

156
00:13:57,628 --> 00:13:59,004
sudah tahu semuanya.

157
00:14:06,971 --> 00:14:08,222
Kenapa ke sini?

158
00:14:08,889 --> 00:14:11,392
Katamu ingin tahu
tentang menjual kekuatan?

159
00:14:12,101 --> 00:14:15,521
Lebih tepatnya aku ingin tahu
benarkah sungguh bisa dijual?

160
00:14:16,522 --> 00:14:17,690
Apakah berbahaya?

161
00:14:17,773 --> 00:14:22,194
Pastinya mereka bisa mencurinya.
Buktinya mereka punya kekuatan Hwa-jin.

162
00:14:22,278 --> 00:14:23,112
Oh.

163
00:14:25,281 --> 00:14:27,241
Tapi, siapa Hwa-jin?

164
00:14:27,324 --> 00:14:29,410
Kau mau melakukannya atau tidak?

165
00:14:37,501 --> 00:14:38,335
Oke.

166
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:41,797
Kita akan tahu jika membuka brankas?

167
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:55,477
Ya, ampun.

168
00:15:03,277 --> 00:15:04,528
MANUSIA SUPER YANG HILANG

169
00:15:11,869 --> 00:15:14,705
DIJUAL 400 JUTA WON,
KEMUNGKINAN KECIL DIBUJUK

170
00:15:18,208 --> 00:15:19,960
DNA KEKUATAN SUPER XG-1…

171
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:25,966
DIJUAL 70 JUTA WON,
DIJUAL 20 JUTA WON

172
00:15:27,384 --> 00:15:28,928
DIJUAL 30 JUTA WON

173
00:15:31,597 --> 00:15:34,850
"Diwariskan ke keturunan
walaupun tidak dihibahkan"?

174
00:15:34,934 --> 00:15:36,101
Apa ini?

175
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:39,563
Jadi, aku akan mewariskan ini ke anakku?

176
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:42,274
Ya, sama seperti pewarisan harta.

177
00:15:45,736 --> 00:15:47,738
Harta macam apa ini?

178
00:15:49,698 --> 00:15:51,283
LEE HWA-JIN

179
00:15:54,745 --> 00:15:56,288
MENYULUT API DAN EKSPLOSIF

180
00:15:56,372 --> 00:15:58,666
DIJUAL SEKITAR 80 JUTA WON

181
00:16:02,086 --> 00:16:03,462
Kukira, dia sudah mati.

182
00:16:08,801 --> 00:16:09,635
Kenapa…

183
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:12,846
tak ada yang menghubungi?

184
00:16:13,430 --> 00:16:15,224
Dia berhasil keluar dari sini.

185
00:16:16,642 --> 00:16:18,227
Aku pun akan begitu.

186
00:16:23,315 --> 00:16:24,149
Sial.

187
00:16:38,205 --> 00:16:40,165
KANG SANG-UNG, KEKUATAN: KUAT, PENYEMBUHAN

188
00:16:40,249 --> 00:16:41,917
PUTRA KANG DONG-GI

189
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,002
SEKITAR 1,3 MILIAR WON

190
00:16:45,379 --> 00:16:47,756
Jangan sampai disentuh Mundane Vanguard.

191
00:16:48,632 --> 00:16:51,427
Dia hidup susah,
materialistis, risiko berkhianat.

192
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,622
BYEON HO-IN, NAMA PENYAKIT: HEPATOMA

193
00:17:20,706 --> 00:17:22,708
Kau harus berhenti minum alkohol.

194
00:17:23,292 --> 00:17:24,752
Prognosisnya buruk.

195
00:17:26,086 --> 00:17:28,047
Sudah beri tahu keluargamu?

196
00:17:34,344 --> 00:17:35,345
Belum.

197
00:17:42,061 --> 00:17:43,896
Kau tak punya banyak waktu.

198
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:46,398
Kau harus siap.

199
00:18:03,707 --> 00:18:05,250
BANG EUN-MI

200
00:18:07,795 --> 00:18:09,755
BANG EUN-MI

201
00:18:20,933 --> 00:18:21,975
Kalau makan…

202
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:27,022
terlalu banyak, kau kenyang.

203
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:30,275
Jika minum berlebihan, kau mabuk.

204
00:18:35,405 --> 00:18:36,698
Semua ada batasnya.

205
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:39,535
Namun,

206
00:18:40,702 --> 00:18:43,372
ada satu hal yang tak terbatas.
Tahu apa itu?

207
00:18:46,625 --> 00:18:47,668
Uang.

208
00:18:48,961 --> 00:18:51,880
Sebanyak apa pun uangmu tetap akan kurang.

209
00:18:54,216 --> 00:18:55,467
Sejak awal,

210
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:57,636
ini di luar kemampuanmu.

211
00:19:00,764 --> 00:19:03,517
Banyak uang di dunia ini.

212
00:19:04,518 --> 00:19:06,603
Artinya, kekuatan dia tak terbatas.

213
00:19:06,687 --> 00:19:09,439
Dia menyadari hal itu.

214
00:19:11,191 --> 00:19:12,025
Lalu?

215
00:19:12,609 --> 00:19:16,613
Lebih baik membelinya walaupun miliaran.

216
00:19:16,697 --> 00:19:19,116
Ayah, itu tidak sengaja.

217
00:19:19,199 --> 00:19:22,286
- Beri aku beberapa hari…
- Kukabari Amerika Serikat.

218
00:19:26,039 --> 00:19:27,833
Dia akan datang minggu depan.

219
00:19:34,381 --> 00:19:36,925
Kau bisa jual beli dengan baik, 'kan?

220
00:19:38,135 --> 00:19:39,511
Bayar makananmu dengan tenaga.

221
00:19:48,145 --> 00:19:49,396
Terima kasih makanannya.

222
00:20:07,372 --> 00:20:09,541
Setiap orang punya kisahnya.

223
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:14,463
Jadi, semua bergerak semaunya.

224
00:20:15,881 --> 00:20:17,007
Begitu pun Ayah,

225
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:19,384
Pengacara Byeon, Roti-mi,

226
00:20:20,135 --> 00:20:21,220
Ketua Park,

227
00:20:21,803 --> 00:20:24,056
dan juga Mundane Vanguard.

228
00:20:44,576 --> 00:20:45,869
Sudah memutuskan?

229
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:49,414
Akan kujual.

230
00:20:53,377 --> 00:20:54,378
Kau butuh berapa?

231
00:21:00,259 --> 00:21:02,970
PEMBAYARAN TAHAP DUA OSAN
DAN SISANYA, 600 JUTA

232
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:09,268
Kalau bingung, aku tentukan sendiri…

233
00:21:09,351 --> 00:21:10,852
4.001.650.000 won.

234
00:21:15,816 --> 00:21:17,985
Apa terlalu mahal?

235
00:21:19,194 --> 00:21:20,404
Oke.

236
00:21:20,487 --> 00:21:21,780
Harusnya minta lebih.

237
00:21:23,615 --> 00:21:26,451
Kuberi tahu waktu dan tempatnya saat siap.

238
00:21:40,299 --> 00:21:41,925
Min-suk!

239
00:21:42,426 --> 00:21:45,012
Min-suk! Aku berhasil!

240
00:21:45,512 --> 00:21:46,346
Terima kasih.

241
00:21:48,682 --> 00:21:50,809
Min-suk!

242
00:21:52,686 --> 00:21:54,313
- Kita sudah makan.
- Lihat.

243
00:21:55,689 --> 00:21:58,734
Hei, kau gila? Kenapa beli ini?

244
00:22:00,027 --> 00:22:02,779
- Kau konglomerat?
- Kau ingin makan ini.

245
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:05,782
Ayo kita nikmati kebebasan seperti ini.

246
00:22:07,367 --> 00:22:08,869
- Cobalah.
- Gila.

247
00:22:08,952 --> 00:22:10,704
Kau sudah gila. Ini mahal.

248
00:22:15,709 --> 00:22:16,710
Kau kenapa?

249
00:22:17,794 --> 00:22:19,421
